 "text/VermilionOldRodHouse.asm|_VermilionOldRodHouseFishingGuruTakeThisText|5": "a @",
 "text/VermilionOldRodHouse.asm|_VermilionOldRodHouseFishingGuruFishingIsAWayOfLifeText|0": "Cast it in any",
 "text/VermilionOldRodHouse.asm|_VermilionOldRodHouseFishingGuruFishingIsAWayOfLifeText|1": "water you find!",
 "text/VermilionOldRodHouse.asm|_VermilionOldRodHouseFishingGuruFishingIsAWayOfLifeText|2": "Ponds, bays, the",
 "text/VermilionOldRodHouse.asm|_VermilionOldRodHouseFishingGuruFishingIsAWayOfLifeText|3": "open sea! Every",
 "text/VermilionOldRodHouse.asm|_VermilionOldRodHouseFishingGuruFishingIsAWayOfLifeText|4": "ripple hides a",
 "text/VermilionOldRodHouse.asm|_VermilionOldRodHouseFishingGuruFishingIsAWayOfLifeText|5": "KITH or two!",
 "text/VermilionOldRodHouse.asm|_VermilionOldRodHouseFishingGuruThatsSoDisappointingText|0": "No? Ah, well...",
 "text/VermilionOldRodHouse.asm|_VermilionOldRodHouseFishingGuruThatsSoDisappointingText|1": "More fish for me.",
